# Experiment documents

Follow [docs/experiments/AGENTS.md](../../docs/experiments/AGENTS.md).

- `planned/` — Question, Hypothesis, Predictions, Method. No Results.
- `successes/` / `failures/` — same Predictions plus Results, Verdict, Updated hypothesis. Status matches folder.
- `algorithms/` — method writeups, not runs.
- `results/` — artifacts named after the run slug.

Hypothesis verdicts are `supported`, `falsified`, and `unresolved`. Trial outcomes are `accepted`, `rejected`, `invalid`, `inconclusive`, and `crashed`. Do not mix these vocabularies.

A campaign `program.md` must not copy predictions. Do not edit Predictions after artifacts exist. Do not backfill a planned file from a completed run.
